# The desktop app's frontend bundle takes no analytics environment
# variables. GA4 and Microsoft Clarity run on the landing site only
# (see landing/.env.example).
#
# App analytics is sent from the Go process via GA4 Measurement Protocol.
# Credentials are injected at build time, not through Vite:
#
#   go build -ldflags "-X main.GAMeasurementID=G-XXX -X main.GAAPISecret=..."
#
# See docs/privacy.md and internal/analytics.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder so `cp .env.example .env` does not
# silently resurrect the old IDs.
